* spmixw.pkg
v 3
d 'SPMIXW': Bayesian spatial panel data models with convex combinations of weight matrices
d
d {bf:spmixw} fits Bayesian fixed-effects panel data models for SAR, SEM,
d SDM, SDEM, SLX and their convex-W counterparts (Debarsy & LeSage 2021).
d Companion command {bf:spmixw_bma} runs Bayesian Model Averaging over
d non-empty subsets of M weight matrices. {bf:estat impact} reports
d LeSage-Pace direct, indirect, and total effects.
d
d Author: Mustapha Wasseja Mohammed
d Support: muswaseja@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260508
d
d Stata version 13.0 or later

* User-facing commands
f ado/spmixw.ado
f ado/spmixw_bma.ado
f ado/spmixw_estat.ado

* Model subroutines
f ado/_spmixw_ols.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sar.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sem.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sdm.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sdem.ado
f ado/_spmixw_slx.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sar_conv.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sem_conv.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sdm_conv.ado
f ado/_spmixw_sdem_conv.ado

* Postestimation
f ado/_spmixw_estat_impact.ado

* Display helpers
f ado/_spmixw_print_table.ado

* Mata library
